  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      134.25,
      419.03,
      453.73,
      434.25
    ],
    "text": "Notice of Calling for Nominations for the Appointment of Mediators",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      442.24,
      542.5,
      503.71
    ],
    "text": "The Mediation Boards Commission, by virtue of the powers vested in it by Section 4(1) of the Mediation (Special Categories of Disputes) Act, No. 21 of 2003, invites nominations for the appointment of Chairman and Mediators in respect of resolving all disputes relating to State Lands and Private Lands subject to the provisions contained in the Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 2261/68 dated 06.01.2022 for the following Panel of Special Mediation Board who is to vacate post in terms of sections 1 to 5 in the Schedule of the Mediation (Special Categories of Disputes) Act No. 21 of 2003.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      514.08,
      542.53,
      599.71
    ],
    "text": "Administrative District Special Mediation Board Areas Date of Vacation of Post Gampaha Gampaha District 30.09.2025 02. The Mediation Boards Commission hereby gives notice calling nominations upon (A) the Individuals, (B) the Bodies, Organizations and Institutions of non political nature, and (C) the District Secretaries/ Divisional Secretaries specified hereinafter under 02 (II) to submit names of person who are eligible under 02 (I) for appointment as Mediators to the Panel of Mediators for the said Special Mediation Board area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      610.24,
      542.5,
      635.71
    ],
    "text": "(I) The following Persons are entitled to be appointed to the Panel of a particular Special Mediation Board Area whose names may be so submitted for appointment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      646.24,
      542.5,
      671.71
    ],
    "text": "(a) A person eligible to be appointed as a Member of the Panel of Mediators in respect of the Special Mediation Boards shall be between 35 to 70 years of age and;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      70.53,
      517.6,
      93.0
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'06'20Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 20.06.20252A",
    "fonts": [
      "Anula",
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      102.78,
      549.8,
      128.25
    ],
    "text": "(b) has any professional qualification obtained from a recognized professional body established by or under any written law;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      138.78,
      236.13,
      152.25
    ],
    "text": "(c) has been or is public officer.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      162.78,
      549.81,
      188.25
    ],
    "text": "(I) (A) The following Individuals are entitled to submit nominations other than themselves for appointment to the Panel of a particular Special Mediation Board area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      198.78,
      549.81,
      236.25
    ],
    "text": "(i) A Public Officer or a Provincial Public Officer serving as the Head of a Department or as the Regional Head of a Department in an office located within the Administrative District at which that particular Special Mediation Board area is situated:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      246.78,
      549.81,
      272.25
    ],
    "text": "(ii) A Head of a Place or religious worship or of school situated in that particular Special Mediation Board area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      282.78,
      549.79,
      344.25
    ],
    "text": "(iii) A retired Head of a Department or School principal residing in that particular Special Mediation Board area; (B) Any board, Organizations or Institution which has been in existence at least for a period of five years and which is engaged in carrying out or doing anyone or more of the under mentioned objectives;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      354.78,
      521.34,
      368.25
    ],
    "text": "(i) The enhancement of educational, religious, moral or spiritual, advancement of the community",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      378.78,
      392.99,
      392.25
    ],
    "text": "(ii) The enhancement of social welfare and eradication of poverty",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      402.78,
      366.18,
      416.25
    ],
    "text": "(iii) The enhancement of rural or community development.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      426.78,
      296.74,
      440.25
    ],
    "text": "(iv) The enhancement of culture of sports",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      450.78,
      549.81,
      512.25
    ],
    "text": "(v) The enhancement of projects, programmes and activities intending providing and supplying basic needs of the peoples such as health, food and shelter etc. (C) The following District Secretaries/Divisional Secretaries are entitled to submit nominations for appointment to the Panel of a particular Special Mediation Board Area:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      522.78,
      549.79,
      548.25
    ],
    "text": "(II) The District Secretaries of the Administrative District in which that Special Mediation Board Area is situated;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      558.78,
      549.8,
      596.25
    ],
    "text": "03. (a) Individual and Boards, Organizations and Institutions referred to in Paragraph (02) above may submit nominations of such Public Officers as are specified in Paragraph 2(a) and 2(b) above. An individual may not nominate his or her name for nominations.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      606.78,
      549.79,
      632.25
    ],
    "text": "(b) District Secretary referred to in Paragraph 2(c) above may submit nominations of Public Officers, of whom not more than five may be appointed by the Commission to the relevant Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      642.78,
      168.24,
      656.25
    ],
    "text": "04. Form of Nominations:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      666.78,
      395.64,
      680.25
    ],
    "text": "(a) Individuals should submit nominations substantially in FORM \u201cA\u201d below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      690.78,
      523.23,
      704.25
    ],
    "text": "(d) Boards, Organizations and Institutions should submit nominations substantially in FORM \u201cB\u201d below; and.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      714.78,
      519.5,
      728.25
    ],
    "text": "(c) District Secretaries, Divisional Secretaries should submit nominations substantially in FORM \u201cC\u201d below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      75.73,
      70.54,
      508.33,
      93.0
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'06'20Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 20.06.2025",
    "fonts": [
